{"id": 130, "name": "Obsidia", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_9c3daef5625bfade5c4cb8a219845dd3.png", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["30", "80", "10", "40"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The ancient Sovereign of the Abyss, risen from ruin, now seeks to slay the God of Darkness and hunt down its Spawns of Decay.", "skills": [{"name": "Return to Bone", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_636c671e6ea7c9fd89e992c42fb9f4dc.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Obsidia gains <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Energy</span> whenever she deals damage. Basic Attacks grant 1 Energy against non-hero units and 2 against hero units. Skills grant Energy equal to 3 times the amount granted by Basic Attacks against the same unit type. No Energy is gained from hitting creeps.\n\nAt 30 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Energy</span>, it forms a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Shard</span> (up to 25 shards). Killing an enemy hero instantly grants 1 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Shard(s)</span>. When Obsidia uses Basic Attacks, all <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Shards</span> strike the target, each dealing <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+6% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> (inherits 6% Attack Effects).\n\nObsidia's Basic Attacks deal 70<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+70% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> (inherits 100% Attack Effects)."}, {"name": "Abyssal Bone Needle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_6a6cfd77d892164ae8fbb98819a7233b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4.5   Mana Cost: 35", "desc": "Obsidia launches an <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyssal Bone Needle</span>, dealing 325<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit and triggering <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Return to Bone</span> on the first enemy hero struck."}, {"name": "Phantom Shadowmeld", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_27b8bf74b5f22a09a7ae1e4d0c69c056.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4.5   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "Obsidia descends into the Abyss and enters <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadowmeld Form</span>, gaining 500% Movement Speed for 0.3s."}, {"name": "Hunt of Bone", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_4b023cbf620869d7596b5e87e467c7c8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "Obsidia shoots <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bones of Wrath</span> in the target direction, dealing 125<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and briefly stunning the first enemy hero hit, then pulls herself to the target. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bones of Wrath</span> tether Obsidia to the enemy, preventing her from moving more than 4 units away. While tethered, the enemy cannot use displacement skills, and their movement will drag Obsidia along. During this time, Obsidia gains 5 temporary <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Bone Shards</span> and 30% Attack Speed. This effect lasts 3s.\n\nWhile tethered, Obsidia can move through obstacles and use Basic Attacks while moving. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phantom Shadowmeld</span> is enhanced, with its duration increased to 1s and cooldown reduced to 33%."}], "builds": [{"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 55.7, "pickRate": 3.85, "spell": {"name": "Aegis", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_673b9e3969e25204fe65e424845b1fcc.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Marksman", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_99f3b68d12e90a6cf8f465ff3a71c850.png", "attrs": ["+15% Extra Attack Speed", "+16 Adaptive Attack", "+5% Lifesteal"]}, "items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89fc7fba69cd82c71d80395af.png"}, {"name": "Demon Hunter Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f63658b2ae982d7684b74fca8163014.png"}, {"name": "Golden Staff", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_98d1154b4f017c7b68a4071e3c5e9364.png"}]}, {"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 53.0, "pickRate": 4.32, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png", "attrs": ["+10% Spell Vamp", "+22 Adaptive Attack", "+6 Extra Physical Defense", "+6 Extra Magic Defense"]}, "items": [{"name": "Windtalker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9c06b97bb75d8a81e28a87df1ab92193.png"}, {"name": "Haas' Claws", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_139190ae1087ea51233fdbefb1bbbf5b.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}]}, {"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 51.9, "pickRate": 2.01, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "All", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4e0cd73